**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules

# JumpStart-specific generated output - large, irrelevant to building JumpStart.csproj itself.
JumpStart/_site
JumpStart/api
JumpStart/docs

# RustArchon-specific local artifacts that shouldn't be baked into an image.
**/App_Data

# Personal local-only source (see RustArchon.Panel/.gitignore's matching *.local.cs pattern and
# SingleUserAuth.cs's own remarks) - excluded here too as a second, independent layer: this keeps it
# out of any image build even if it somehow existed in a working directory that wasn't a clean git
# checkout, on top of the runtime check SingleUserAuth.cs itself does either way.
**/*.local.cs
